297
00:10:21,917 --> 00:10:22,957
my shares at a premium.

298
00:10:25,878 --> 00:10:26,317
Meng,

299
00:10:27,238 --> 00:10:28,118
trust me,

300
00:10:28,118 --> 00:10:29,077
I'm on your side.

301
00:10:29,557 --> 00:10:30,118
Besides,

302
00:10:30,758 --> 00:10:31,518
Jiali has

303
00:10:31,638 --> 00:10:32,597
weathered storms before.

304
00:10:33,317 --> 00:10:34,197
If we join forces,

305
00:10:35,797 --> 00:10:36,917
we can get through this.

306
00:10:44,077 --> 00:10:45,158
The problem right now is

307
00:10:46,158 --> 00:10:47,197
Han Guang already holds

308
00:10:47,238 --> 00:10:48,158
five percent of shares.

309
00:10:48,797 --> 00:10:49,597
Per company bylaws,

310
00:10:50,238 --> 00:10:51,917
he can call a board meeting.

311
00:10:52,398 --> 00:10:53,557
If he proposes to fund

312
00:10:53,638 --> 00:10:54,238
in the meeting,

313
00:10:55,118 --> 00:10:56,358
we may not be able to stop him.

314
00:10:57,358 --> 00:10:58,557
Given the company's state,

315
00:10:58,998 --> 00:11:00,278
no one will turn down money.

316
00:11:02,597 --> 00:11:03,118
Okay,

317
00:11:04,638 --> 00:11:05,797
get Jiali out of crisis.

318
00:11:07,597 --> 00:11:08,638
You stall Han Guang.

319
00:11:09,518 --> 00:11:10,460
I'll raise the funds.

320
00:11:11,677 --> 00:11:12,038
Okay.

321
00:11:12,638 --> 00:11:14,083
You accepted Han Guang's terms?

322
00:11:14,158 --> 00:11:14,998
Of course not.

323
00:11:16,077 --> 00:11:17,158
Jiali's valuation has

324
00:11:17,317 --> 00:11:18,437
been halved by him.

325
00:11:19,638 --> 00:11:20,638
How dare he

326
00:11:20,957 --> 00:11:22,158
demand a ten percent premium!

327
00:11:22,278 --> 00:11:23,437
It's like daylight robbery!

328
00:11:24,038 --> 00:11:25,038
Do you want me to accept?

329
00:11:25,317 --> 00:11:26,118
Of course not.

330
00:11:27,038 --> 00:11:28,077
Bringing him in now

331
00:11:28,197 --> 00:11:29,317
is like playing with fire.

332
00:11:30,398 --> 00:11:31,878
I'm more worried about Di Liren.

333
00:11:32,597 --> 00:11:33,238
Are you two

334
00:11:33,238 --> 00:11:34,478
joining forces now?

335
00:11:35,238 --> 00:11:36,238
Only for Jiali's sake.

336
00:11:36,797 --> 00:11:37,837
He has his desires.

337
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:38,957
I have my interests.

338
00:11:42,998 --> 00:11:43,597
It's fine.

339
00:11:44,197 --> 00:11:45,677
This is all public business info.

340
00:11:45,837 --> 00:11:46,317
It's okay.

341
00:11:48,758 --> 00:11:50,038
I'll ask my former clients

342
00:11:50,158 --> 00:11:50,797
about

343
00:11:50,837 --> 00:11:51,797
potential investments.

344
00:11:52,077 --> 00:11:52,917
Let's figure it out.

345
00:11:55,158 --> 00:11:55,597
Meng.

346
00:11:56,957 --> 00:11:57,677
Xu, Zi.

347
00:11:57,717 --> 00:11:58,238
You are here.

348
00:11:59,317 --> 00:12:00,398
I fixed the water pipe.

349
00:12:00,638 --> 00:12:01,118
Almost

350
00:12:01,317 --> 00:12:02,557
dropped this down the drain.

351
00:12:03,158 --> 00:12:03,837
You could've

352
00:12:03,917 --> 00:12:04,758
called a handyman

353
00:12:04,758 --> 00:12:05,797
or asked me for this.

354
00:12:06,437 --> 00:12:07,837
A kid

355
00:12:08,758 --> 00:12:09,437
doesn't know how.

356
00:12:09,917 --> 00:12:11,557
We overseas students know everything.

357
00:12:11,797 --> 00:12:12,957
And stop seeing me

358
00:12:12,957 --> 00:12:13,518
as a kid.

359
00:12:14,437 --> 00:12:14,957
Right, Meng,

360
00:12:15,437 --> 00:12:16,398
can I talk to you

361
00:12:16,478 --> 00:12:17,358
in private?

362
00:12:21,358 --> 00:12:22,077
What's up, Harry?

363
00:12:22,717 --> 00:12:23,557
What is it?

364
00:12:24,717 --> 00:12:25,118
Meng,

365
00:12:25,677 --> 00:12:26,238
I overheard

366
00:12:26,238 --> 00:12:27,118
what Jiao Xu said.

367
00:12:27,717 --> 00:12:29,077
Someone embezzled Jiali's funds.

368
00:12:29,957 --> 00:12:30,597
I want to know

369
00:12:31,197 --> 00:12:32,197
how much money that was.

370
00:12:32,557 --> 00:12:33,917
It has nothing to do with you.

371
00:12:34,197 --> 00:12:34,957
Besides,

372
00:12:35,717 --> 00:12:36,957
you shouldn't talk about it.

373
00:12:37,638 --> 00:12:38,278
Meng,

374
00:12:38,837 --> 00:12:39,717
don't see me as a kid.

375
00:12:39,758 --> 00:12:40,557
I'm a grown man.

376
00:12:41,398 --> 00:12:41,878
If

377
00:12:42,638 --> 00:12:43,677
I pay back the money

378
00:12:43,717 --> 00:12:44,398
with interest,

379
00:12:45,238 --> 00:12:46,238
can you spare my parents?

380
00:12:46,837 --> 00:12:48,238
If you want to be seen as an adult,

381
00:12:48,917 --> 00:12:50,038
stop running away from home

382
00:12:50,077 --> 00:12:50,797
like kids.

383
00:12:52,518 --> 00:12:52,837
But...

384
00:12:53,278 --> 00:12:54,677
Your mom already came to me.

385
00:12:55,038 --> 00:12:56,557
You can't crash on the sofa forever.

386
00:12:56,837 --> 00:12:57,638
Once you cool off,

387
00:12:57,837 --> 00:12:58,677
go back home.

388
00:13:09,758 --> 00:13:10,317
Here, Mr. Liu.

389
00:13:10,717 --> 00:13:11,197
Cheers.

390
00:13:17,518 --> 00:13:18,158
Ms. Yu,

391
00:13:18,478 --> 00:13:19,957
Jiali's current situation

392
00:13:20,557 --> 00:13:21,478
is really hard

393
00:13:21,597 --> 00:13:22,197
to read.

394
00:13:22,317 --> 00:13:23,758
Jiali's development

395
00:13:24,077 --> 00:13:25,758
is definitely stable and positive.

396
00:13:27,118 --> 00:13:27,478
Mr. Liu,

397
00:13:28,797 --> 00:13:29,957
you're well aware

398
00:13:30,358 --> 00:13:31,478
of our technical barriers

399
00:13:31,878 --> 00:13:32,837
and market roadmap.

400
00:13:33,317 --> 00:13:34,758
All we need now

401
00:13:34,837 --> 00:13:35,797
is some investment.

402
00:13:36,478 --> 00:13:37,797
Once funding is in place...

403
00:13:38,758 --> 00:13:40,158
Anyone can make empty promises.

404
00:13:40,917 --> 00:13:41,717
What I want

405
00:13:42,038 --> 00:13:42,917
is actually simple.

406
00:13:43,478 --> 00:13:44,478
Overhaul the core team,

407
00:13:45,437 --> 00:13:46,518
halve the product lines.

408
00:13:47,038 --> 00:13:48,797
Plus an authorization condition.

409
00:13:49,238 --> 00:13:50,597
If in six months,

410
00:13:50,837 --> 00:13:51,638
the value of company

411
00:13:51,677 --> 00:13:52,677
can't grow by 30 percent,

412
00:13:52,677 --> 00:13:53,878
I will force an exit.

413
00:13:55,917 --> 00:13:57,158
So you mean

414
00:13:57,638 --> 00:13:58,717
you want to invest low

415
00:13:59,597 --> 00:14:00,358
and flip it high?

416
00:14:00,917 --> 00:14:02,077
If the company is doomed,

417
00:14:03,038 --> 00:14:04,797
at least I can safely

418
00:14:04,837 --> 00:14:05,998
recover my principal.

419
00:14:06,158 --> 00:14:07,118
Mr. Liu, listen.

420
00:14:07,437 --> 00:14:08,278
We can

421
00:14:08,597 --> 00:14:09,518
agree on other terms,

422
00:14:09,797 --> 00:14:10,518
but on this point,

423
00:14:11,118 --> 00:14:12,278
we really can't accept.

424
00:14:15,518 --> 00:14:17,358
Given Jiali's current
financial situation,

425
00:14:18,478 --> 00:14:19,358
except me,

426
00:14:19,837 --> 00:14:20,677
hardly anyone dares

427
00:14:20,717 --> 00:14:21,957
touch this mess.

428
00:14:27,878 --> 00:14:28,677
Think it over.

429
00:14:29,638 --> 00:14:30,437
Let's call it a day.

430
00:14:31,238 --> 00:14:32,638
It's only a temporary crisis.

431
00:14:33,358 --> 00:14:33,998
Five years ago,

432
00:14:34,557 --> 00:14:35,677
Jiali's market share

433
00:14:36,158 --> 00:14:36,998
was lower than now.

434
00:14:38,437 --> 00:14:39,878
But we still made through.

435
00:14:42,998 --> 00:14:43,317
Hello,

436
00:14:44,077 --> 00:14:44,677
Mr. Liu.

437
00:14:46,557 --> 00:14:47,998
I'm the chairman of Jiali Cosmetics,

438
00:14:48,278 --> 00:14:48,758
Di Liren.

439
00:14:50,197 --> 00:14:50,717
Mr. Di,

440
00:14:51,118 --> 00:14:51,837
nice to meet you.

441
00:14:53,437 --> 00:14:54,717
However, I notice something

442
00:14:55,317 --> 00:14:56,677
in what you just said.

443
00:14:58,398 --> 00:15:00,238
You took over your own family company,

444
00:15:00,398 --> 00:15:01,597
so you should put everything

445
00:15:02,038 --> 00:15:02,837
into it.

446
00:15:03,238 --> 00:15:05,038
But I'm putting up my own money

447
00:15:05,437 --> 00:15:06,518
to save your company.

448
00:15:07,238 --> 00:15:08,437
And I'm taking a gamble

449
00:15:09,077 --> 00:15:10,158
on whether you and Ms. Yu

450
00:15:10,717 --> 00:15:12,437
can bring Jiali back from the dead.

451
00:15:18,197 --> 00:15:18,557
Wine.

452
00:15:18,557 --> 00:15:19,278
Give it to me.

453
00:15:24,238 --> 00:15:24,957
Since you've

454
00:15:25,118 --> 00:15:26,317
put it so clearly, Mr. Liu,

455
00:15:26,677 --> 00:15:28,197
we will definitely

456
00:15:28,238 --> 00:15:29,238
give it our all.

457
00:15:32,557 --> 00:15:33,557
But, Mr. Liu,

458
00:15:34,557 --> 00:15:35,238
give us some room

459
00:15:35,317 --> 00:15:36,158
to maneuver.

460
00:15:37,038 --> 00:15:38,197
That'll keep us motivated,

461
00:15:38,518 --> 00:15:39,998
and your effort won't be in vain.

462
00:15:40,278 --> 00:15:41,317
After all, what we want

463
00:15:41,717 --> 00:15:42,478
is a win-win.

464
00:15:45,758 --> 00:15:46,437
Don't you agree,

465
00:15:47,597 --> 00:15:48,038
Mr. Liu?

466
00:16:00,118 --> 00:16:01,638
Since we can't see eye to eye,

467
00:16:02,597 --> 00:16:04,038
maybe we can work together one day.

468
00:16:07,278 --> 00:16:07,758
Excuse me.

469
00:16:15,642 --> 00:16:19,197
(Wu Ta)

470
00:16:19,197 --> 00:16:20,002
Di Liren and Mr. Liu

471
00:16:20,002 --> 00:16:20,638
are connected.

472
00:16:21,197 --> 00:16:22,197
No wonder

473
00:16:22,197 --> 00:16:23,478
he showed up that day.

474
00:16:23,758 --> 00:16:24,957
I knew he was up to no good.

475
00:16:25,717 --> 00:16:26,597
He even tried to

476
00:16:26,878 --> 00:16:27,957
bait me into selling

477
00:16:28,158 --> 00:16:29,077
my shares to Mr. Liu.

478
00:16:30,197 --> 00:16:31,358
Then when we divorce,

479
00:16:31,597 --> 00:16:32,717
he could take half.

480
00:16:33,077 --> 00:16:34,278
By then, his shares

481
00:16:34,638 --> 00:16:35,398
would exceed mine.

482
00:16:35,878 --> 00:16:36,398
So,

483
00:16:37,118 --> 00:16:38,317
you'd work with Han Guang?

484
00:16:40,478 --> 00:16:41,358
At least I know

485
00:16:41,758 --> 00:16:43,158
what Han Guang wants right now.

486
00:16:43,638 --> 00:16:44,398
I knew

487
00:16:44,437 --> 00:16:45,717
we'd have a talk,

488
00:16:46,038 --> 00:16:46,717
but unexpectedly,

489
00:16:46,957 --> 00:16:47,957
you came to me yourself.

490
00:16:49,158 --> 00:16:50,238
Isn't this what you've

491
00:16:50,518 --> 00:16:51,398
always wanted?

492
00:16:52,238 --> 00:16:53,437
There are no eternal enemies,

493
00:16:53,797 --> 00:16:54,957
only eternal interests.

494
00:16:56,557 --> 00:16:57,797
You see the bigger picture.

495
00:16:58,478 --> 00:16:59,557
Name your terms.

496
00:16:59,717 --> 00:17:01,518
I've always been direct in business.

497
00:17:02,518 --> 00:17:03,278
As long as

498
00:17:03,677 --> 00:17:04,548
it's a nice offer.

499
00:17:05,278 --> 00:17:05,718
I hold

500
00:17:05,758 --> 00:17:06,998
45 percent of Jiali's shares.

501
00:17:07,958 --> 00:17:09,357
I can sell you ten percent

502
00:17:09,758 --> 00:17:10,918
as a private transaction.

503
00:17:11,678 --> 00:17:12,758
However, on two conditions.

504
00:17:13,278 --> 00:17:13,637
First,

505
00:17:14,077 --> 00:17:15,758
you stop the sales of Jingyue.

506
00:17:16,438 --> 00:17:16,797
Second,

507
00:17:17,198 --> 00:17:18,157
you use your channels

508
00:17:18,797 --> 00:17:19,797
to promote Jinghua.

509
00:17:23,718 --> 00:17:24,278
First term,

510
00:17:24,958 --> 00:17:25,637
no.

511
00:17:26,077 --> 00:17:26,918
I can use my channels

512
00:17:26,998 --> 00:17:27,758
to promote Jinghua.

513
00:17:27,837 --> 00:17:28,958
But I want 15 percent

514
00:17:29,958 --> 00:17:30,678
of shares.

515
00:17:33,637 --> 00:17:34,077
Okay.

516
00:17:34,678 --> 00:17:36,518
If you stop selling Jingyue immediately,

517
00:17:37,357 --> 00:17:38,278
15 percent is fine.

518
00:17:39,438 --> 00:17:42,157
Do you know how profitable Jingyue is?

519
00:17:45,198 --> 00:17:47,157
What if I can get you

520
00:17:48,157 --> 00:17:49,357
a seat on the board?

521
00:18:00,238 --> 00:18:00,678
Deal.

522
00:18:03,201 --> 00:18:04,248
Pleasure working with you.

523
00:18:04,637 --> 00:18:05,718
Likewise.

524
00:18:16,278 --> 00:18:17,758
Bringing Han Guang into this.

525
00:18:18,357 --> 00:18:19,038
You really took

526
00:18:19,958 --> 00:18:21,278
a risky move.

527
00:18:22,837 --> 00:18:23,317
Listen.

528
00:18:23,837 --> 00:18:25,998
This is a strategic baiting.

529
00:18:26,637 --> 00:18:28,077
Throw meat to two hungry wolves,

530
00:18:28,198 --> 00:18:29,958
and they'll tear into each other first.

531
00:18:30,877 --> 00:18:32,317
Aren't you afraid they'll team up

532
00:18:32,518 --> 00:18:33,157
and bite you?

533
00:18:35,478 --> 00:18:36,278
They won't.

534
00:18:37,157 --> 00:18:37,678
Look,

535
00:18:38,797 --> 00:18:40,077
once Han Guang gets in Jiali,

536
00:18:40,397 --> 00:18:41,877
would he still let Di Liren

537
00:18:42,317 --> 00:18:43,597
play middleman and take a cut?

538
00:18:44,198 --> 00:18:46,317
So to Di Liren right now,

539
00:18:46,557 --> 00:18:47,317
Han Guang's threat

540
00:18:47,317 --> 00:18:48,157
is bigger than mine.

541
00:18:48,918 --> 00:18:50,117
So you're still gambling.

542
00:18:52,117 --> 00:18:53,357
Unless you have no dirt on him,

543
00:18:53,637 --> 00:18:54,157
otherwise,

544
00:18:54,478 --> 00:18:55,633
if he doesn't bite today,

545
00:18:55,797 --> 00:18:56,678
he might bite you

546
00:18:56,758 --> 00:18:58,198
anytime

547
00:18:58,357 --> 00:18:59,077
in the future.

548
00:19:01,397 --> 00:19:02,637
I also wish I could

549
00:19:02,718 --> 00:19:03,557
enter the battlefield

550
00:19:03,837 --> 00:19:05,357
with the absolute certainty.

551
00:19:07,438 --> 00:19:09,038
But life doesn't allow me.

552
00:19:09,557 --> 00:19:10,831
I can only play it by ear.

553
00:19:11,758 --> 00:19:12,877
Once the fight starts,

554
00:19:13,278 --> 00:19:13,998
I can't retreat.

555
00:19:14,357 --> 00:19:15,678
I have to charge ahead anyway.

556
00:19:17,797 --> 00:19:18,797
You are practically

557
00:19:19,117 --> 00:19:20,278
paying out of pocket

558
00:19:20,397 --> 00:19:21,438
to cover Jiali's losses.

559
00:19:21,877 --> 00:19:22,998
If anything goes wrong,

560
00:19:23,038 --> 00:19:23,597
no one

561
00:19:24,438 --> 00:19:25,494
in Jiali will help you.

562
00:19:28,518 --> 00:19:29,918
Honestly, I'm a bit tired.

563
00:19:30,478 --> 00:19:31,518
It might help Jiali

564
00:19:31,837 --> 00:19:33,157
in the short term,

565
00:19:34,157 --> 00:19:35,397
but I can't keep pulling Jiali

566
00:19:35,918 --> 00:19:36,758
out of the mud

567
00:19:36,797 --> 00:19:37,998
every single time.

568
00:19:38,678 --> 00:19:39,718
So this time,

569
00:19:40,557 --> 00:19:41,758
rather than keep fighting,

570
00:19:42,357 --> 00:19:43,758
I'd rather lost

571
00:19:43,958 --> 00:19:44,877
some short-term gains,

572
00:19:45,238 --> 00:19:46,198
making them

573
00:19:46,557 --> 00:19:47,397
turn on each other.

574
00:19:48,238 --> 00:19:49,198
Besides,

575
00:19:49,637 --> 00:19:50,758
I'm also trying

576
00:19:51,117 --> 00:19:52,278
to find a way out for myself.

577
00:19:54,357 --> 00:19:54,958
What way out?

578
00:19:57,038 --> 00:19:58,038
You'll see.

579
00:19:59,758 --> 00:20:01,198
Jinghua is what matters most now.

580
00:20:01,758 --> 00:20:02,998
Once the knockoffs are halted,

581
00:20:02,998 --> 00:20:03,478
that's when

582
00:20:03,518 --> 00:20:04,518
we make our comeback.

583
00:20:05,117 --> 00:20:06,837
Everyone at the company

584
00:20:07,157 --> 00:20:08,117
put so many efforts

585
00:20:08,317 --> 00:20:09,438
into this product.

586
00:20:09,678 --> 00:20:10,397
You know what?

587
00:20:10,998 --> 00:20:12,518
Ding got bald patches by hard work.

588
00:20:13,198 --> 00:20:13,877
And Mr. Dong

589
00:20:14,198 --> 00:20:15,238
got so many more wrinkles.

590
00:20:16,077 --> 00:20:17,478
It's time to show those knockoffs

591
00:20:17,718 --> 00:20:18,518
once and for all

592
00:20:18,797 --> 00:20:20,518
what the genuine products

593
00:20:20,557 --> 00:20:21,117
are.

594
00:20:23,397 --> 00:20:25,157
Look at you, Queen Yu Meng.

595
00:20:26,198 --> 00:20:27,877
